      "edit": 6,
      "source": "29-appendix-g.md",
      "chapter": "EPUB/text/ch034.xhtml",
      "width": 390,
      "text": "The twenty-four precedents contain seventy-two practices. This year plan selects and adapts some of them, alongside a few chapter exercises: twelve months, each with a theme and a handful of actions. It isn’t a complete checklist of all seventy-two. The tag after an action (P-12, say) points back to its story. Choose one action to begin each month, then add others as time allows. Move a month if your season or your life needs it, and choose a scale you can sustain.",
